Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:04.34,Nar,,0,0,0,,Every day, small businesses across India miss customer calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:08.25,Nar,,0,0,0,,The owner is busy at the counter, the shop has closed for the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.68,Nar,,0,0,0,,or two phones ring at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:13.50,Nar,,0,0,0,,Each missed call can be a booking that goes to the shop next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.58,Nar,,0,0,0,,Alaap is an AI front desk for these shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:21.79,Nar,,0,0,0,,It answers phone calls, WhatsApp and web chat in Hindi, Punjabi and English,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:23.92,Nar,,0,0,0,,the way customers actually speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:26.17,Nar,,0,0,0,,It books appointments, takes orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.78,Nar,,0,0,0,,and passes anything it can't solve to the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:33.50,Nar,,0,0,0,,Here's a live call to a demo salon. The caller's voice is synthesized;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.38,Nar,,0,0,0,,everything else is the live app.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:33.67,Nar,,0,0,0,,The booking lands in the owner's dashboard right away, with the customer's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:34.75,Nar,,0,0,0,,number and reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.87,Nar,,0,0,0,,A WhatsApp confirmation and a reminder are queued automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:42.81,Nar,,0,0,0,,WhatsApp isn't connected in this demo, so they wait in the outbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:45.97,Nar,,0,0,0,,The voice runs on Gnani AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:50.69,Nar,,0,0,0,,Gnani's Prisma speech recognition streams the caller's audio in real time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:54.16,Nar,,0,0,0,,understands Hindi, Punjabi, English and code-mixed speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:57.15,Nar,,0,0,0,,and detects when the caller has finished speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:02:00.86,Nar,,0,0,0,,Gnani's Timbre text-to-speech gives the assistant its voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.86,0:02:02.57,Nar,,0,0,0,,streamed sentence by sentence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:06.73,Nar,,0,0,0,,so it starts talking while the rest of the reply is still being prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:09.08,Nar,,0,0,0,,Owners run it in plain language.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:13.01,Nar,,0,0,0,,Asking it to make the facial nine hundred rupees updates the price list.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:20.07,Nar,,0,0,0,,New shops are set up in minutes: paste a rate card or a photo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.07,0:02:24.38,Nar,,0,0,0,,and the language model reads the services, prices and hours for review.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.67,Nar,,0,0,0,,Under the hood: FastAPI and Next.js,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:34.46,Nar,,0,0,0,,with Gnani for speech and Google Gemini for reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:38.81,Nar,,0,0,0,,Nothing is booked until the customer hears a read-back and says yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:40.84,Nar,,0,0,0,,Row locks prevent double bookings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:43.88,Nar,,0,0,0,,and forty-four automated tests guard the behaviour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:48.72,Nar,,0,0,0,,Alaap gives every small shop a front desk that never misses a call,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:52.40,Nar,,0,0,0,,speaks its customers' language, and never invents a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:54.78,Nar,,0,0,0,,Alaap. Har call ka jawab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:42.94,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Sat Sri Akal! This is Riya from Glow Unisex Salon. This call is recorded. How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:51.30,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5CC8F0&}Caller:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Sat Sri Akal. Can I get a gents haircut tomorrow at 6:30 pm? My name is Rohit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:52.98,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Hello, Rohit ji!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.80,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} There's a free slot for a haircut tomorrow at 6:30 pm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:56.78,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Could you tell me your 10-digit mobile number?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:01:01.72,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Then I'll confirm the booking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:08.42,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5CC8F0&}Caller:{\c&HFFFFFF&} My number is 98123 45670.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:15.42,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Okay Rohit ji: tomorrow 6:30 pm, haircut with Gurpreet, ₹200. Shall I confirm it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:20.38,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5CC8F0&}Caller:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Yes, please confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:22.19,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.23,0:01:24.21,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Your booking number is 5161. A WhatsApp confirmation is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:29.41,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Anything else I can help with, Rohit ji?
